### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@organizationId = 1
@roomId = 1
@deviceId = 1
@sensorId = 1
@credentialId = 1
@deviceToken = replace-with-the-one-time-provisioned-token
@csrfToken = replace-with-xsrf-cookie-value

# Administration requests require a SUPER_ADMIN session and CSRF protection.
# First log in, call GET /api/csrf, then send the X-XSRF-TOKEN cookie value as
# the X-XSRF-TOKEN header for POST, PUT, PATCH, and DELETE requests.

### List devices, optionally filtered by organization
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/devices?organizationId={{organizationId}}

### Get one device
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/{{deviceId}}

### Register a room-scoped HTTP device
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "roomId": {{roomId}},
  "name": "Room gateway",
  "type": "GATEWAY"
}

### Activate or deactivate a device
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/{{deviceId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Assign an existing sensor to a device channel
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/{{deviceId}}/sensors/{{sensorId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "channelKey": "temperature"
}

### Create a sensor and device channel together
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/{{deviceId}}/sensor-channels
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "name": "Humidity",
  "type": "HUMIDITY",
  "unit": "%",
  "channelKey": "humidity",
  "minSafeValue": 30,
  "maxSafeValue": 70
}

### List configured channels
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/{{deviceId}}/channels

### Remove a sensor channel assignment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/{{deviceId}}/sensors/{{sensorId}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### List credential metadata (never returns the raw token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/{{deviceId}}/credentials

### Provision the first credential; copy token from this one-time response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/{{deviceId}}/credentials/provision
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Rotate the active credential
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/{{deviceId}}/credentials/rotate
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Revoke a credential
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devices/{{deviceId}}/credentials/{{credentialId}}/revoke
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

# Device ingestion does not use the user session or CSRF token.

### Submit an idempotent device reading
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/device/readings
Authorization: Device {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "temperature",
  "value": 22.4,
  "measuredAt": "2026-09-01T12:00:00+02:00",
  "messageId": "gateway-1-000001"
}

### Retry with the same messageId; response status is already_processed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/device/readings
Authorization: Device {{deviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "temperature",
  "value": 22.4,
  "measuredAt": "2026-09-01T12:00:00+02:00",
  "messageId": "gateway-1-000001"
}
